{#
settings/templates/_editor.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
One template: its name, where it is filed, an optional subject, and the body.

TWO CONTROLLERS ON ONE FORM. `compose--compose-toolbar` is the same controller
behind the compose window's editor and the signature editor, so bold here is
bold there. `settings--template-editor` adds what only a template has:
variables. It draws each `{{token}}` in the stored text as a chip, inserts new
ones, edits the two kinds that have settings, and writes the chips back as
tokens into the two hidden inputs when the form is submitted.

The toolbar controller is deliberately NOT given a `hiddenInput` target here.
It would mirror the editor's innerHTML into it on every keystroke — chips and
all — and the server would be sent the editor's rendering of a variable in
place of the variable. The body input belongs to the template controller,
which is the one that knows the difference.

THE SUBJECT IS A CONTENTEDITABLE TOO, a one-line one, for the same reason the
body is: a variable in it is a chip you can click, not a row of braces to type
correctly.

The settings of a date or signature variable appear in a strip under the body
when its chip is selected, rather than in a popover on the chip. The editor is
a frame inside a card inside a pane, each of which clips, and a strip in the
flow needs no positioning to survive any of them.

Delete and Duplicate are forms of their own after the main one, reached from
the footer by `form=`: a form cannot nest, and they post to different routes
with different tokens.

Variables:
  template          MailTemplate   unsaved for "new"
  errors            list<string>   translation keys
  tree              TemplateTree
  location          string         key of where the template is filed
  variables         list<TemplateVariable>
  dateFormats       list<{value, example}>
  signatureChoices  list<{argument, label}>
  chipLabels        the wording of a chip, see TemplateEditorViewData::chipLabels()
#}
{% import '_partials/_select.html.twig' as select %}
{% set field = "block w-full min-h-9 rounded-lg border border-field bg-field px-3 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent" %}
{% set label = "block text-[13px] font-medium text-ink-soft mb-1.5" %}
{% set sb = "shrink-0 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover transition-colors" %}
{% set quiet = "inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover transition-colors cursor-pointer" %}

<turbo-frame id="template-editor" class="block">
    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_templates_save') }}"
          data-controller="compose--compose-toolbar settings--template-editor"
          data-action="submit->settings--template-editor#store"
          data-compose--compose-toolbar-i18n-value="{{ {
              linkAdd:     'compose.link.add'|trans,
              linkEdit:    'compose.link.edit'|trans,
              linkInvalid: 'compose.link.invalid'|trans,
              linkUnsafe:  'compose.link.unsafe'|trans,
          }|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
          data-settings--template-editor-variables-value="{{ variables|map(v => v.value)|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
          data-settings--template-editor-preview-url-value="{{ path('app_settings_templates_preview') }}"
          data-settings--template-editor-date-url-value="{{ path('app_settings_templates_date_example') }}"
          data-settings--template-editor-i18n-value="{{ chipLabels|merge({
              sampleRecipient:    'settings.templates.sample_recipient'|trans,
              previewUnavailable: 'settings.templates.preview_unavailable'|trans,
              noSubject:          'settings.templates.preview_no_subject'|trans,
          })|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
          class="relative">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('template_save') }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ template.id }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="{{ template.subject }}"
               data-settings--template-editor-target="subjectInput">
        <input type="hidden" name="body" value="{{ template.body|e('html_attr') }}"
               data-settings--template-editor-target="bodyInput">

        {% if errors|length %}
            <div role="alert" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 border-b border-line alert-danger text-sm text-danger">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <div class="space-y-0.5">
                    {% for error in errors %}<p class="leading-snug">{{ error|trans }}</p>{% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="px-4 py-4 space-y-4">
            {# ── Name + folder ──────────────────────────────────────────── #}
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                    <label for="template-name" class="{{ label }}">{{ 'settings.templates.name'|trans }}</label>
                    <input id="template-name" name="name" type="text" required maxlength="255"
                           {{ template.id ? '' : 'autofocus' }}
                           value="{{ template.name }}"
                           placeholder="{{ 'settings.templates.name_placeholder'|trans }}"
                           class="{{ field }} h-9">
                </div>
                <div class="sm:w-60 min-w-0">
                    <label for="template-location" class="{{ label }}">{{ 'settings.templates.folder'|trans }}</label>
                    <select id="template-location" name="location" {{ select.enhance() }}
                            data-settings--template-editor-target="location"
                            class="select-field w-full h-9 text-sm">
                        <option value="root" {{ 'root' == location ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ 'settings.templates.top_level'|trans }}</option>
                        {% for node in tree.locations %}
                            <option value="{{ node.location.key }}" {{ node.location.key == location ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ node.path }}</option>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Subject ────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
            <div>
                <span id="template-subject-label" class="{{ label }}">
                    {{ 'settings.templates.subject'|trans }}
                    <span class="font-normal text-ink-faint">· {{ 'settings.templates.subject_hint'|trans }}</span>
                </span>
                <div data-settings--template-editor-target="subject"
                     data-action="keydown->settings--template-editor#singleLine paste->settings--template-editor#pastePlain"
                     contenteditable="true"
                     role="textbox"
                     aria-labelledby="template-subject-label"
                     data-placeholder="{{ 'settings.templates.subject_placeholder'|trans }}"
                     class="{{ field }} py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden
                            empty:before:content-[attr(data-placeholder)]
                            empty:before:text-ink-faint
                            empty:before:pointer-events-none">{{ template.subject }}</div>
            </div>

            {# ── Body ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
            <div>
                <span id="template-body-label" class="{{ label }}">{{ 'settings.templates.body'|trans }}</span>

                {# Not overflow-hidden, unlike the signature editor's box: the
                   variable menu hangs out of the toolbar and would be clipped
                   to nothing. The corners are rounded on the two children
                   instead. #}
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 border-b border-line bg-sunken px-1.5 py-1 rounded-t-lg">
                        <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                                data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#bold"
                                title="{{ 'compose.bold'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.bold'|trans }}"
                                class="{{ sb }} font-bold">B</button>
                        <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                                data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#italic"
                                title="{{ 'compose.italic'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.italic'|trans }}"
                                class="{{ sb }} italic">I</button>
                        <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                                data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#underline"
                                title="{{ 'compose.underline'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.underline'|trans }}"
                                class="{{ sb }} underline">U</button>
                        <div class="w-px h-4 bg-line mx-1"></div>
                        <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                                data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#unorderedList"
                                title="{{ 'compose.list.unordered'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.list.unordered'|trans }}"
                                class="{{ sb }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                                data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#insertLink"
                                title="{{ 'compose.insert_link'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.insert_link'|trans }}"
                                class="{{ sb }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>

                        {# ── Insert variable ──────────────────────────────
                           A <details>, so it opens and closes without a line
                           of JavaScript and is a disclosure to a screen
                           reader without any ARIA written by hand. The
                           buttons hold the pointer's mousedown back
                           (keepCaret) because a button that takes focus
                           takes the caret out of the field the variable is
                           meant to land in. #}
                        <details class="relative ml-auto" data-settings--template-editor-target="menu">
                            <summary class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-7 px-2.5 rounded-lg list-none cursor-pointer
                                            text-xs font-medium text-accent-text bg-accent-soft hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-code text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                {{ 'settings.templates.insert_variable'|trans }}
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-[9px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="absolute right-0 top-full mt-1 z-20 w-60 py-1 rounded-pane border border-line bg-surface shadow-pop">
                                {% for group in ['recipient', 'sender', 'date'] %}
                                    <p class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-faint">
                                        {{ ('settings.templates.group.' ~ group)|trans }}
                                    </p>
                                    {% for variable in variables|filter(v => v.group == group) %}
                                        <button type="button"
                                                data-variable="{{ variable.value }}"
                                                data-action="mousedown->settings--template-editor#keepCaret click->settings--template-editor#insert"
                                                class="flex w-full items-center px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                                            {{ variable.labelKey|trans }}
                                        </button>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </div>

                    <div data-compose--compose-toolbar-target="editor"
                         data-settings--template-editor-target="body"
                         contenteditable="true"
                         role="textbox"
                         aria-multiline="true"
                         aria-labelledby="template-body-label"
                         data-placeholder="{{ 'settings.templates.body_placeholder'|trans }}"
                         class="min-h-[180px] px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink outline-none rounded-b-lg
                                empty:before:content-[attr(data-placeholder)]
                                empty:before:text-ink-faint
                                empty:before:pointer-events-none">{{ template.body|raw }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Settings of the selected variable ──────────────────────────
               Hidden until a date or signature chip is selected. Both groups
               are in the markup from the start and the controller shows one:
               nothing here is built in JavaScript, so every word of it is
               translated where every other word is. #}
            <div data-settings--template-editor-target="inspector" hidden
                 class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-sunken px-3 py-3">

                <div data-settings--template-editor-target="dateFields" hidden class="space-y-3">
                    <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink-soft">{{ 'settings.templates.date.heading'|trans }}</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-2">
                        <div>
                            <label for="template-date-amount" class="block text-xs text-ink-faint mb-1">{{ 'settings.templates.date.offset'|trans }}</label>
                            <input id="template-date-amount" type="number" min="0" max="9999" step="1" value="0"
                                   data-settings--template-editor-target="amount"
                                   data-action="input->settings--template-editor#update"
                                   class="{{ field }} h-9 w-20">
                        </div>
                        <select aria-label="{{ 'settings.templates.date.unit'|trans }}"
                                data-settings--template-editor-target="unit"
                                data-action="change->settings--template-editor#update"
                                class="select-field h-9 text-sm">
                            {% for unit in ['d', 'w', 'm'] %}
                                <option value="{{ unit }}">{{ ('settings.templates.unit.' ~ unit)|trans }}</option>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </select>
                        <select aria-label="{{ 'settings.templates.date.direction'|trans }}"
                                data-settings--template-editor-target="direction"
                                data-action="change->settings--template-editor#update"
                                class="select-field h-9 text-sm">
                            <option value="+">{{ 'settings.templates.date.after'|trans }}</option>
                            <option value="-">{{ 'settings.templates.date.before'|trans }}</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-2">
                        <div>
                            <label for="template-date-format" class="block text-xs text-ink-faint mb-1">{{ 'settings.templates.date.format'|trans }}</label>
                            <select id="template-date-format"
                                    data-settings--template-editor-target="format"
                                    data-action="change->settings--template-editor#update"
                                    class="select-field h-9 text-sm">
                                {% for format in dateFormats %}
                                    <option value="{{ format.value }}">{{ ('settings.templates.format.' ~ format.value)|trans }} — {{ format.example }}</option>
                                {% endfor %}
                                <option value="custom">{{ 'settings.templates.format.custom'|trans }}</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div data-settings--template-editor-target="patternRow" hidden>
                            <label for="template-date-pattern" class="block text-xs text-ink-faint mb-1">{{ 'settings.templates.date.pattern'|trans }}</label>
                            <input id="template-date-pattern" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="dd.MM.yyyy"
                                   data-settings--template-editor-target="pattern"
                                   data-action="input->settings--template-editor#update"
                                   class="{{ field }} h-9 w-40 font-mono">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint">
                        {{ 'settings.templates.date.example'|trans }}
                        <span data-settings--template-editor-target="example" aria-live="polite" class="text-ink font-medium"></span>
                    </p>
                    <p data-settings--template-editor-target="patternHint" hidden class="text-xs text-ink-faint">
                        {{ 'settings.templates.date.pattern_hint'|trans }}
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div data-settings--template-editor-target="signatureFields" hidden class="space-y-2">
                    <label for="template-signature" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink-soft">{{ 'settings.templates.signature.heading'|trans }}</label>
                    <select id="template-signature"
                            data-settings--template-editor-target="signature"
                            data-action="change->settings--template-editor#update"
                            class="select-field h-9 text-sm max-w-full">
                        <option value="">{{ 'settings.templates.signature.automatic'|trans }}</option>
                        {% for choice in signatureChoices %}
                            <option value="{{ choice.argument }}">{{ choice.label }}</option>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </select>
                    <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.templates.signature.hint'|trans }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ── Preview ────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
            <div data-settings--template-editor-target="preview" hidden
                 class="rounded-lg border border-line">
                <p class="px-3 py-2 border-b border-line bg-sunken text-xs text-ink-faint rounded-t-lg">
                    {{ 'settings.templates.preview_heading'|trans }}
                </p>
                <p data-settings--template-editor-target="previewSubject" class="px-3 pt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink"></p>
                <div data-settings--template-editor-target="previewBody" class="px-3 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-t border-line bg-sunken">
            {% if template.id %}
                <button type="submit" form="template-delete-form" class="{{ quiet }} hover:text-danger">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-trash-can text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{ 'settings.templates.delete'|trans }}
                </button>
                <button type="submit" form="template-duplicate-form" class="{{ quiet }}">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-copy text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{ 'settings.templates.duplicate'|trans }}
                </button>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 ml-auto">
                <button type="button" data-action="click->settings--template-editor#preview"
                        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-eye text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{ 'settings.templates.preview'|trans }}
                </button>
                <a href="{{ path('app_settings_templates_cancel') }}"
                   class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                    {{ 'form.cancel'|trans }}
                </a>
                <button type="submit"
                        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-accent-ink bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                    {{ 'form.submit'|trans }}
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{ include('compose/_link_popover.html.twig', {
            id:    'template-editor',
            class: 'absolute left-4 top-48 w-80 max-w-[calc(100%-2rem)]',
        }, with_context = false) }}
    </form>

    {% if template.id %}
        <form id="template-delete-form" method="post"
              action="{{ path('app_settings_templates_delete', { id: template.id }) }}"
              data-turbo-confirm="{{ 'settings.templates.delete_confirm'|trans({ '%name%': template.name }) }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('template_delete' ~ template.id) }}">
        </form>
        <form id="template-duplicate-form" method="post"
              action="{{ path('app_settings_templates_duplicate', { id: template.id }) }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('template_duplicate' ~ template.id) }}">
        </form>
    {% endif %}
</turbo-frame>
